From: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Local: media: cedrus: match vendor H264 rate control

Match vendor rate models and preserve raw encoder statistics.
Write valid H264 filler NAL units for CBR output.

Signed-off-by: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
---
